{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Step into <strong>Mimi\u2019s Restaurant Helper</strong>, a charming\u00a0<strong>2D cooking game</strong> that brings the nostalgic energy of 2000s anime and flash games to life! Master the art of crafting stunning dishes, tackle engaging challenges, and dive into fun mini-games that keep the kitchen excitement flowing.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791620/extras/5a8f719824b1da11a0eced6c042c11c1.poster.avif?t=1770965737\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791620/extras/5a8f719824b1da11a0eced6c042c11c1.webm?t=1770965737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make pizzas, prep ingredients, fry food, clean up, take orders, and more! A fun mix of puzzles, time management, and cooking challenges in one game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791620/extras/6cb883ffb15369dcca00c1c3c93d52ef.poster.avif?t=1770965737\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791620/extras/6cb883ffb15369dcca00c1c3c93d52ef.webm?t=1770965737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791620/extras/a5c14792d78221e67231e39b62914d66.avif?t=1770965737\" width=250 height=103 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Sup